{"slug": "due-date-calculator", "title": "Due Date Calculator", "h1": "Due Date Calculator", "category": "fitness-and-health", "categoryTitle": "Fitness and Health Calculators", "description": "This free due date calculator estimates the due date based on the menstrual cycle, ultrasound, conception date, or IVF transfer date.", "html": "<div id=\"breadcrumbs\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList\"><span itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a href=\"/index\" itemprop=\"item\"><span itemprop=\"name\">home</span></a><meta content=\"1\" itemprop=\"position\"/></span> / <span itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a href=\"/fitness-and-health-calculator\" itemprop=\"item\"><span itemprop=\"name\">fitness &amp; health</span></a><meta content=\"2\" itemprop=\"position\"/></span> / <span itemprop=\"itemListElement\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"https://schema.org/ListItem\"><a href=\"/due-date-calculator\" itemprop=\"item\"><span itemprop=\"name\">due date calculator</span></a><meta content=\"3\" itemprop=\"position\"/></span></div> <h1>Due Date Calculator</h1>\n<p>The Due Date Calculator estimates the delivery date of a pregnant woman based on her last menstrual period (LMP), ultrasound, conception date, or IVF transfer date.</p>\n<div id=\"insmdc\"><img alt=\"Modify the values and click the calculate button to use\" height=\"35\" src=\"/img/svg/insm.svg\" width=\"630\"/></div><div class=\"panel\"><form name=\"calform\"><table align=\"center\">\n<tr>\n<td>Estimate Based On:\t\t<select name=\"ccalcmethod\" onchange=\"switchSel(this.value);\">\n<option selected=\"\" value=\"last period\">Last Period</option>\n<option value=\"ultrasound\">Ultrasound</option>\n<option value=\"conception date\">Conception Date</option>\n<option value=\"ivf\">IVF Transfer Date</option>\n</select>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"padding:10px 0px;\">\n<table id=\"cilastperiod\"><tr